Templates use {variable|format}. Advance:
Variabel, templat, dan ekspresi: {variable|format}  {= expression | format}
Referensi fungsi dan format: + - * / % ^  > >= < <= == !=  && / || / !  ?:  ??  if() min/max/avg/sum/clamp/round
Nilai kemajuan: = expression
Contoh: {= if(memory.usage >= 80, 'High', 'OK')}
